Data e hora: 15 de fevereiro de Showa 28 (1953)
Moderador: Tomizō Ishii
Participantes: Tatsu Oda, Kansaku Kataoka, Tatsuo Uesaka, Tomizō Matsumoto, Shika Yamamoto, Teiichi Nabata, Shūzaburō Tsuchiya, Nao Tsuchida, Sue Tsuchiya, Masao Itō, Shintarō Kitami (mais cerca de quarenta participantes)
